synthetic: true
Every rule and every test case in this directory was written for this repository.
The attack-shaped calls in the test cases are reconstructed from public write-ups of
agent attacks (tool poisoning, a poisoned support ticket, an issue that asks an agent to
publish private repository names, a settings edit that turns on auto-approval). None is a
real transcript, none holds a real credential or a live address, and every download address
uses a reserved name that cannot resolve (`.invalid`, `example.com`).
